# Essential Commands

## Frontend (Node.js >= 18.13.0, <= 22.x)

```bash
npm run dev           # Vite dev server + Pyodide fetch (localhost:5173)
npm run dev:5050      # Same on port 5050
npm run build         # Production build (runs pyodide:fetch first)
npm run check         # Type-check with svelte-check
npm run lint          # ESLint + svelte-check + pylint
npm run lint:frontend # ESLint only (auto-fix)
npm run lint:backend  # pylint backend/
npm run format        # Prettier (frontend)
npm run format:backend # Ruff format (backend)
npm run test:frontend # Vitest
npm run i18n:parse    # Re-parse i18n translation keys
```

## Backend (Python >= 3.11, < 3.13)

```bash
open-webui serve --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080
uvicorn open_webui.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --reload
pytest test/ -k "test_name"
pylint backend/
ruff format . --exclude .venv && ruff check .
```

## Docker

```bash
docker compose up -d
docker compose up -d --build
make install  # same as docker compose up -d
```
